   "text": "Non-Cash Transactions"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Our bank provides services on different non – cash transactions to resident and non – resident legal entities. The rates for the services provided to customers are approved by the Board of Directors."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Our bank provides the following services for non – cash transactions to its customers:"
  },
